# This is a static GitHub profile repository; it has no local application runtime.
# No local environment variables are required to render or preview the checked-in files.
#
# GitHub Actions provides GITHUB_TOKEN automatically to workflows where needed.
# The productive-time workflow optionally reads SUMMARY_GITHUB_TOKEN as a GitHub
# Actions repository secret. Configure it in GitHub Settings > Secrets and variables
# > Actions; do not paste its value here or commit a populated .env file.
#
# External profile services manage their own credentials and settings.
# Keep this example free of real tokens, passwords, and personal data.
